Subject: [PATCH] Add Vector Editor page embedding the VectorCraft web build

- /dashboard/vector-editor: iframe host for public/vectorcraft (or NEXT_PUBLIC_VECTORCRAFT_URL), with a not-installed notice
- Add Vector Editor to dashboard nav and the /tools grid
- Cache headers for the hashed wasm/js files, no-cache for index.html

